        <mxCell id="nm4fWMabEApBUTIsR-SC-56" value="fl-client-application represents the federated learning cllient. It provides the necessary methods to read and write data through sockets. This applcation is used to mimic the download of the global model at the start of the training and the model update transmission to the server" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=none;" parent="nm4fWMabEApBUTIsR-SC-55" vertex="1">
